---
title: bogmode.ca v2 is up
date: 2026-07-04
summary: A rebuild from the ground up. Next.js 16, a git-based CMS and a working contact form, with every route passing the build.
art: site-v2
---

I rebuilt the site from scratch.

- **Next.js 16.** It's fast, it's static where it can be and it deploys on Vercel.
- **Keystatic for content.** Every page lives as a file in the repo. I edit in a GUI, and the changes ship as git commits.
- **A contact form that works.** Messages go out through Resend.
- **Eleven routes, all green.** The first build passed end to end.

This is the base everything else gets built on.
